      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "会忽视细节，比如疏忽了注意眼前的弯道。\n也有可能会跟其他孩子碰撞或发生冲突。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1201f58244eb97ac7c60b8d1fe8d97df78b6442edbbddcdec3aafb5a1e9db424",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
